    // start page
    "SASE 管理画面 操作トレーニング（非公式・架空の製品）": "SASE console training (unofficial, fictional products)", "実機に触る前に、": "Before touching the real thing,", "管理画面の操作を体で覚える。": "learn the console by doing.",
    "「Kato Cloud 管理画面（KMC）操作要領」の手順を、本番に影響しない練習用の画面で試せます。ルールを追加して Save し、Publish するまでの流れを、何度でもやり直せます。": "Try the steps of the Kato Cloud console (KMC) how-to guide on practice screens that cannot affect production. Repeat the flow of adding a rule, saving and publishing as often as you like.",
